  "review": {
    "note": "Reviewed all 15 Python and 3 Node direct dependency entries against the 0.22.1 receipt. No dependency constraints changed (manifest hash unchanged). Two registry candidates moved: hatchling 1.32.0 -> 1.32.3 (build and optional:dev) and coordinated core h2hdb 0.39.7 -> 0.39.10 (runtime); every other candidate is unchanged and still satisfies its declared bounds. hatchling 1.32.3 (2026-09-17) only preserves the core-metadata version string as written for stylized CalVer versions; this project uses PEP 440 canonical 0.22.2, so wheel metadata is unaffected. Reviewed core history 0.39.7..0.39.10 (merges 656c6fe, 8e23ced, 713b950, fe32ba7, 3cfba6c): pattern-matching refactors, a new CurrentOnlyCleanupTerminalState ingest-side enum, ingest observability and cleanup performance work; the CatalogReader discovery/facet/recent/tag contracts, domain values and epoch-3/schema-7 consumer surface that h2hdb-opds uses are unchanged. Installed h2hdb 0.39.10 and hatchling 1.32.3 into the repository-local environment through uv; all 38 installed packages pass uv pip check, and the bounded non-deep pytest profile (scripts/run-checks.py pytest with H2HDB_CORE_REPOSITORY set to a 0.39.10 core checkout) passed 870 tests in 54s. The 0.22.2 patch release only widens the search DSL quote grammar to accept U+201D as an opening delimiter; public APIs, data formats and dependency manifests are unchanged.",
